  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.07 Capital improvement program (CIP)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.07 “Capital improvement program (CIP)” means the plan of proposed spending for capital items based on projects of municipality needs, fiscal capability, and demand for services, as permitted in RSA 674:5.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
